  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Founded on the Humanitarian-Development-Peace &#x201C;triple&#x201D; nexus approach, UNDP is responding to Cyclone Mocha through a dual approach, a combination of a rapid and early recovery response, and a long-term support for economic and social resilience of communities affected by the cyclone, including the displaced and ethnic minorities.</narrative>
